{"id":"241f39a3-2930-4066-97db-d036189c161f","createdAt":"2026-10-25T05:22:38.504Z","batchId":"login_claude-sonnet-5-5-subscription_medium","approach":"html","modelId":"claude-sonnet-5-5-subscription","settings":{"effort":"medium"},"presetId":"login","prompt":"A login form with email, password, a \"remember me\" option and a sign-in button.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"stack gap-lg\" style=\"max-width:420px;margin:0 auto;\">\n    <div class=\"stack center\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n      <div class=\"avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">N</div>\n      <h1 class=\"h2\">Welcome back</h1>\n      <p class=\"muted\">Sign in to your account to continue.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <form id=\"login\" class=\"stack\" novalidate>\n        <div id=\"err\" class=\"alert alert-destructive\" role=\"alert\" style=\"display:none;\"></div>\n\n        <label>\n          Email address\n          <input type=\"email\" id=\"email\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@example.com\" autocomplete=\"email\" required>\n          <span class=\"small muted\">Use the email you registered with.</span>\n        </label>\n\n        <label>\n          <span class=\"row between\"><span>Password</span><a href=\"#\" class=\"small\" id=\"forgot\">Forgot password?</a></span>\n          <input type=\"password\" id=\"pw\" name=\"password\" placeholder=\"Enter your password\" autocomplete=\"current-password\" required minlength=\"8\">\n        </label>\n\n        <div class=\"row between\">\n          <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"remember\" name=\"remember\"> Remember me</label>\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" id=\"toggle\">Show password</button>\n        </div>\n\n        <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-lg btn-block\" id=\"submit\">Sign in</button>\n      </form>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"small muted\" style=\"text-align:center;\">Don't have an account? <a href=\"#\">Create one</a></p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n  const f = document.getElementById('login'), err = document.getElementById('err');\n  const pw = document.getElementById('pw'), email = document.getElementById('email');\n  document.getElementById('toggle').addEventListener('click', e => {\n    const show = pw.type === 'password';\n    pw.type = show ? 'text' : 'password';\n    e.target.textContent = show ? 'Hide password' : 'Show password';\n  });\n  document.getElementById('forgot').addEventListener('click', e => {\n    e.preventDefault();\n    err.className = 'alert';\n    err.textContent = 'Password reset instructions will be sent to your email once you enter it above.';\n    err.style.display = 'block';\n  });\n  f.addEventListener('submit', e => {\n    e.preventDefault();\n    let msg = '';\n    if (!/^[^@\\s]+@[^@\\s]+\\.[^@\\s]+$/.test(email.value)) msg = 'Please enter a valid email address.';\n    else if (pw.value.length < 8) msg = 'Password must be at least 8 characters.';\n    if (msg) {\n      err.className = 'alert alert-destructive';\n      err.textContent = msg;\n      err.style.display = 'block';\n      return;\n    }\n    err.style.display = 'none';\n    const b = document.getElementById('submit');\n    b.disabled = true;\n    b.textContent = 'Signing in…';\n    setTimeout(() => {\n      b.disabled = false;\n      b.textContent = 'Sign in';\n      err.className = 'alert';\n      err.textContent = 'Signed in successfully' + (document.getElementById('remember').checked ? ' — you will be remembered on this device.' : '.');\n      err.style.display = 'block';\n    }, 900);\n  });\n</script>","deltas":[[1583,"<div class=\"page\">"],[1926,"\n  <div class=\"stack"],[1926," g"],[1926,"ap-lg\" style=\"max"],[1926,"-width:420px;margin"],[1927,":0 auto;"],[1927,"\">\n    <div class=\"st"],[1927,"ack center\""],[1927," style=\"text-align:center;"],[1927,"\">\n      <div class=\"av"],[1927,"atar\" a"],[1948,"ria-hidden=\"true\">"],[1977,"N"],[2276,"</div>\n      <h1"],[2276," "],[2276,"class=\"h2\">Welc"],[2276,"ome back</h1>\n      "],[2276,"<p class=\"mu"],[2276,"ted\">Sign in to your"],[2276," account to continue."],[2277,"</p>\n    </div>"],[2283,"\n\n    <div class=\"card\">"],[2312,"\n      <form id=\"login"],[2344,"\""],[2377," class=\"stack\" novalid"],[2627,"ate>\n        <div id"],[2627,"=\"err"],[2627,"\" class"],[2627,"=\"alert alert-destruct"],[2627,"ive\" role"],[2627,"=\"alert\" style=\"display:"],[2627,"none;"],[2642,"\"></div>\n\n        <label"],[2676,">\n          Email address\n          "],[2710,"<input type=\"email\" id"],[2744,"=\"email\" name=\"email\" plac"],[2777,"eholder=\"you@example."],[2976,"com\" autocomplete=\""],[2976,"email\" required>\n          "],[2976,"<span"],[2976," class=\"small mu"],[2976,"ted\">"],[2976,"Use the"],[3009," email you regist"],[3042,"ered with.</span>\n        "],[3076,"</label>\n\n        <label>"],[3109,"\n          <span"],[3142," class=\"row between\""],[3176,"><span>Password</span><"],[3326,"a href=\"#\" class=\"small"],[3326,"\" id=\"forgot\">"],[3326,"Forgot password?</a></"],[3326,"span>\n          <input type=\""],[3344,"password\" id=\"pw\" name"],[3377,"=\"password\" placeholder=\""],[3411,"Enter your password\" autoc"],[3444,"omplete=\"current"],[3477,"-password\" required min"],[3511,"length=\"8\">\n        "],[3544,"</label>\n\n        <div"],[3578," class=\"row between\">\n          <"],[3676,"label class=\"check\""],[3676,"><input type=\"checkbox"],[3677,"\" id=\"remember\" name=\""],[3711,"remember\"> Remember me"],[3745,"</label>\n         